  "id": "ALAS2023-2024-664",
  "title": "Amazon Linux 2023 - ALAS2023-2024-664: Important priority package update for ghostscript",
  "issued": {
    "date": "2024-07-18 01:24:00"
  },
  "updated": {
    "date": "2024-07-22 16:00:00"
  },
  "severity": "Important",
  "description": "Package updates are available for Amazon Linux 2023 that fix the following vulnerabilities:\nCVE-2024-29510:\n\tArtifex Ghostscript before 10.03.1 allows memory corruption, and SAFER sandbox bypass, via format string injection with a uniprint device.\n\nAmazon Linux has assessed CVE-2024-29510 impacting Ghostscript. The complexity of the fixes required results in a high regression risk to the functionality of the code. This functionality risk outweighs the risk posed by the CVE fix. Amazon Linux will not be shipping a fix for CVE-2024-29510 on AL1.\n",
